      "messages": {
        "202420000": {
          "id": 202420000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "这段时间你们都辛苦了，等眼下的事情结束，我来筹备列车组的大聚餐吧",
          "next": [
            202420001
          ]
        },
        "202420001": {
          "id": 202420001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "顺便再为大家露一手，有兴趣和我一起备餐吗？",
          "next": [
            202420002,
            202420005,
            202420008
          ]
        },
        "202420002": {
          "id": 202420002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "好呀，谁来掌勺！我吗？还是姬子姐？",
          "next": [
            202420003
          ]
        },
        "202420003": {
          "id": 202420003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "虽然听上去都不太靠谱……",
          "next": [
            202420004
          ]
        },
        "202420004": {
          "id": 202420004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "放心，我不掌勺",
          "next": [
            202420010
          ]
        },
        "202420005": {
          "id": 202420005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "好呀！姬子姐掌勺，我来帮忙试吃",
          "next": [
            202420006
          ]
        },
        "202420006": {
          "id": 202420006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "等等，姬子姐掌勺……",
          "next": [
            202420007
          ]
        },
        "202420007": {
          "id": 202420007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "放心，我不掌勺",
          "next": [
            202420010
          ]
        },
        "202420008": {
          "id": 202420008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "上次姬子姐露一手后，我们可没少往卫生间跑，就当运动了！",
          "next": [
            202420009
          ]
        },
        "202420009": {
          "id": 202420009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "放心，这种事情不会再发生了",
          "next": [
            202420010
          ]
        },
        "202420010": {
          "id": 202420010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "仓库里有一台我之前手搓的炒菜机，我打算请它出马",
          "next": [
            202420011
          ]
        },
        "202420011": {
          "id": 202420011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "虽然有些零件生锈了，也是时候翻新一番",
          "next": [
            202420012
          ]
        },
        "202420012": {
          "id": 202420012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "上次说检修列车时带你一起，这次正好要修炒菜机，它们的原理共通，想着可以叫上你",
          "next": [
            202420013,
            202420014,
            202420016
          ]
        },
        "202420013": {
          "id": 202420013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "修理列车和修炒菜机的原理共通在…？",
          "next": [
            202420017
          ]
        },
        "202420014": {
          "id": 202420014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "原来是这个「露一手」，不愧是我们的修理达人姬子老师！",
          "next": [
            202420015
          ]
        },
        "202420015": {
          "id": 202420015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "不过…它们的原理共通在…？",
          "next": [
            202420017
          ]
        },
        "202420016": {
          "id": 202420016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我也要修列车…不是，我也要修炒菜机吗…不是，它们的原理共通在…？",
          "next": [
            202420017
          ]
        },
        "202420017": {
          "id": 202420017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "能量传输、热力循环、机械转动等原理大差不差，只是一个驱动星辰，一个驱动锅铲",
          "next": [
            202420018
          ]
        },
        "202420018": {
          "id": 202420018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "除此之外，它还需要一个智炒系统，以适应不同口味所需的火候与咸淡",
          "next": [
            202420019
          ]
        },
        "202420019": {
          "id": 202420019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "这也和研究领航员和列车长的驾驶习惯异曲同工",
          "next": [
            202420020,
            202420027
          ]
        },
        "202420020": {
          "id": 202420020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "也就是说，只要我学会了修炒菜机，就会修星穹列车了……",
          "next": [
            202420021
          ]
        },
        "202420021": {
          "id": 202420021,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "next": [
            202420022
          ]
        },
        "202420022": {
          "id": 202420022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "没错，是这个道理",
          "next": [
            202420023
          ]
        },
        "202420023": {
          "id": 202420023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我乱说的啊！",
          "next": [
            202420024
          ]
        },
        "202420024": {
          "id": 202420024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "没关系，我没乱说",
          "next": [
            202420025
          ]
        },
        "202420025": {
          "id": 202420025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "相信我，到时候上手时你就知道了~",
